00:31:32,680 --> 00:31:34,960
Unajua, mimi...

743
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:35,200
Hufanyi filamu?

744
00:31:36,300 --> 00:31:38,940
Viungo vya binadamu vinaweza kufanya mambo mengi.

745
00:31:39,500 --> 00:31:41,120
Watu wengi hawana mikono.

746
00:31:51,220 --> 00:31:51,740
Hapana.

747
00:31:56,040 --> 00:31:57,720
Huwezi kutumia hatua hiyo.

748
00:32:09,700 --> 00:32:10,800
Sina tatizo.

749
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:13,740
Kwa nini kitu hiki kiko nyuma?

750
00:32:13,740 --> 00:32:14,640
Mistari ya pundamilia.

751
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:15,060
Ndiyo.

752
00:32:15,060 --> 00:32:16,360
Onyesho.

753
00:32:16,360 --> 00:32:18,720
Kidogo kidogo [kisicho wazi].

754
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:22,140
Imekamilika, sivyo?

755
00:32:22,140 --> 00:32:24,360
[Haijulikani], ni sawa.

756
00:32:24,360 --> 00:32:24,980
Ni sawa.

757
00:32:24,980 --> 00:32:26,700
Sio kitu ambacho hakitakuwa wazi. [unclear]

758
00:32:26,700 --> 00:32:27,200
Ni...

759
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:28,260
Haijalishi sana.

760
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:33,340
Kuna nini cha kurekodi?

761
00:32:33,340 --> 00:32:34,740
Hakuna kitu.

762
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:35,200
Hapana.

763
00:32:35,220 --> 00:32:36,980
Wanajifanya kuwa maiti sasa.

764
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:44,460
[haijulikani] [haijulikani]. Mara tu ikiisha, haitakuwa na maana tena.

765
00:32:44,460 --> 00:32:46,000
Inaweza kurekodi dakika ngapi zaidi?

766
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,600
Unaona wapi hilo? Hapa?

767
00:32:47,600 --> 00:32:49,280
Dakika ishirini.

768
00:32:49,280 --> 00:32:50,700
Sikufanya hivyo kimakusudi.

769
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:52,040
Ni tu...

770
00:32:54,220 --> 00:32:55,260
Ni vigumu.

771
00:32:55,260 --> 00:32:57,640
Ni kwamba tu mimi ni mgumu ku...

772
00:32:58,520 --> 00:32:59,600
Rouse.

773
00:32:59,600 --> 00:33:01,060
[Haijulikani] njia ya kawaida.

774
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:03,380
Ni njia gani inaweza kukuamsha?

775
00:33:03,380 --> 00:33:04,280
Unajua?

776
00:33:05,380 --> 00:33:06,260
Vigumu sana.

777
00:33:07,780 --> 00:33:09,040
Lakini ninapotazama tamthilia [isiyoeleweka] ...

778
00:33:09,040 --> 00:33:11,220
Je, hiyo ilikuwa hasira halisi?

779
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,280
Huwezi kurekebisha urefu wa fokasi kwenye hili.

780
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:16,400
Hilo lilikuwa jambo la ajabu. Hilo ndilo ninalosema, sivyo?

781
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,140
Nini?

782
00:33:18,900 --> 00:33:20,040
Haina maana.

783
00:33:20,040 --> 00:33:21,680
Ni sawa. Ninafurahia tu.

784
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:22,360
Ah.

785
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:27,760
Hiyo... jamani.

786
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,720
Hiyo?

787
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:30,780
tamthilia [isiyo wazi].

788
00:33:30,780 --> 00:33:32,160
Walikasirika kidogo.

789
00:33:32,780 --> 00:33:34,820
Lakini ninaelewa kwa nini ulikasirika.

790
00:33:35,220 --> 00:33:36,580
Kwa sababu ilikuwa karibu tu kukamilika.

791
00:33:36,580 --> 00:33:37,420
Walikuingilia kati.

792
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,820
Ninapenda [haijulikani].

793
00:33:43,860 --> 00:33:44,920
Skrini inaweza kugeuka.

794
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:46,880
Baada ya kuigeuza?

795
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,500
Namaanisha, skrini inaweza kugeuka.

796
00:33:48,500 --> 00:33:50,140
Kwa hivyo unaweza [haueleweki].

797
00:33:55,580 --> 00:33:56,880
Hiyo ni baridi sana, sivyo?

798
00:33:58,100 --> 00:33:59,620
Sikufanya hivyo kimakusudi.

799
00:33:59,620 --> 00:34:01,480
Sikufanya hivyo kimakusudi.

800
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,140
Sawa, nimeelewa.

801
00:34:02,140 --> 00:34:02,360
Ni tu...

802
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:04,020
Kisha wewe...

803
00:34:05,320 --> 00:34:06,580
Baada ya thelathini.

804
00:34:06,580 --> 00:34:08,340
Bado nina miaka michache.

805
00:34:10,220 --> 00:34:10,740
Hapana.

806
00:34:11,580 --> 00:34:12,680
Rafiki yangu aliniambia...

807
00:34:13,220 --> 00:34:16,220
Kuna kupungua kwa kasi baada ya miaka ishirini na sita.

808
00:34:16,220 --> 00:34:17,600
Nina umri wa miaka ishirini na minne mwaka huu.

809
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:18,140
[haijulikani]

810
00:34:20,500 --> 00:34:22,760
Sio kupungua.

811
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:25,280
Huwezi kuhisi kitu hicho.

812
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:26,320
Ni kisaikolojia.

813
00:34:27,180 --> 00:34:28,900
Daima ni kisaikolojia.

814
00:34:28,900 --> 00:34:29,980
Hilo linawezaje kuwa hivyo?

815
00:34:29,980 --> 00:34:34,080
Mwili unaweza kupona haraka sana.

816
00:34:36,500 --> 00:34:40,180
Kwa mazoezi kidogo tu, mwili unaweza kupona haraka sana.

817
00:34:40,180 --> 00:34:41,340
Ndiyo.

818
00:34:41,340 --> 00:34:44,060
Hapana, [haijulikani] arobaini au hamsini si tatizo.

819
00:34:44,780 --> 00:34:45,540
Ndiyo.

820
00:34:45,540 --> 00:34:48,700
Mwili ndio kitu rahisi zaidi. Unaweza kuudhibiti.

821
00:34:48,700 --> 00:34:50,360
Inachosha sana. Sitaki kutazama hii.

822
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:52,460
Halafu wewe na mpenzi wako wa zamani [haijulikani]?

823
00:34:52,460 --> 00:34:53,940
Sasa mambo yalikuwaje na mpenzi wako wa zamani?

824
00:34:55,740 --> 00:34:56,420
Hilo halikufanya kazi pia.

825
00:34:56,420 --> 00:34:58,740
Sio kwamba haikufanya kazi. Ilikuwa tu baadaye...
